# Nothing in this spike is generated: there is no build step, no `npm install`
# and no `node` on the path at any point.
#
# `vendor/` holds the published `oidc-client-ts` browser bundle, committed on
# purpose so the spike runs with no network and so nothing in this repository's
# login path reaches a CDN. Convention says a directory with that name is build
# output; here it is source, and this negation says so out loud — and keeps it
# tracked if a `vendor/` rule ever appears further up the tree.
!vendor/
